---
const words = ['Music.', 'Radio.', 'Film.', 'Graphic design.', 'UX.', 'XR.', 'AI.'];
---
<section id="pattern" class="pattern night" data-theme="night" data-section="pattern" aria-labelledby="pattern-h">
  <ul class="pattern-words" role="list">
    {words.map((w) => <li>{w}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>It looks like seven careers. It's one pattern. I wanted to make something, I didn't know the tool, so I learned it, and the tool became the next thing.</p>
  <h2 id="pattern-h" class="pattern-h">The only constant was <span class="lit">curiosity</span>.</h2>
</section>
